@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About";
}

<div class="two-col">
    <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">PawCare is a grooming and care studio built around one idea: a calm pet makes for a better groom.</p>
        <p>We keep appointments unhurried, work with one pet at a time and take notes on what each animal likes, so every return visit is easier than the last.</p>
        <p>Our team is trained in handling dogs, cats and small animals, and we use shampoos and tools chosen for sensitive skin.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
        <h2>What we stand for</h2>
        <ul class="ticks">
            <li>Gentle handling, never rushed</li>
            <li>Clear prices before you book</li>
            <li>Notes kept on every pet's needs</li>
            <li>Clean tools and sanitised stations</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
